Analysis: QMP and monitor socket both work for programmatic keyboard input - great! However, nginx is returning 502 Bad Gateway. The issue is likely with the nginx config. Since websockify was started with `--web /usr/share/novnc`, it already serves the noVNC static files. I should configure nginx to proxy everything to websockify on port 6080.
Plan: 1. Reconfigure nginx to proxy all requests to websockify (which serves both static noVNC files and WebSocket connections)
2. Restart nginx
3. Verify web interface works
4. Give Windows 3.11 time to boot
